title: Grappling Hook
text: When a linked beam goes through a second tangler, it forgets its old twin and makes a new pair with its new partner. Paint the ring red, then paint the flukes without touching the ring.
trick: entangled twin; a second tangler breaks the link
motif: grappling hook
ink: 2.5
accept: idea
expect: recolours>=2
